{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“λ-演算”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"λ-演算"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>#计算机科学</p>\n<h2>计算与约化</h2>\n<p>计算 $\\lambda$-表达式的主要过程是 $\\beta$-约化, 例如\n$$\r\n(\\lambda x.x+1)3=3+1.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>还有另外一些规则: $\\alpha$-约化是说 $(\\lambda x.fx)=(\\lambda y.fy)$, $\\eta$-约化是说 $(\\lambda x.fx)=f$.</p>\n"}}